# Host-machine build artifacts must never be copied into the image — they carry absolute
# Windows paths and a different restore graph than the container's own fresh restore, which
# corrupts `dotnet publish` (NETSDK1064) if copied in after `dotnet restore` runs in-container.
**/bin/
**/obj/
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.angular/
.git/
.vs/
